# AI AGENT CODING RULES
- Rule 1: Always enforce 1 module per file (1 code = 1 module).
- Rule 2: Maximum limit per file is 300 lines of code.
- Rule 3: Keep services in `src/services/`, custom hooks in `src/hooks/`, and UI components in `src/components/`.
- Rule 4: All API keys and secrets MUST be read from `.env` environment variables ONLY.
- Rule 5: Always link task assignees, authors, and event participants to `activeProject.members` (Gmail invited team).
